'''Xenoknife''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtained from purchasing it individually from the Xenoknife Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Xenotech Bundle]] for 3,499 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade is primarily purple, with black details stretching across. It has a small black guard and a thin black handle with faint purple lines. The pommel is black with purple spikes protruding from it.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly gun [[Xenoshot]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Xeno Set|Xeno Set]].
* This knife, alongside it's gun and effect counterparts, were originally red before being changed to purple shortly after.

